Author: Chenxin Jiang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Chenxin Jiang <chenxin.jiang@example.org>
Description: Fits count regression models for candidate enhancer-gene pairs,
    generates synthetic null statistics by residual resampling, and calibrates
    a shared empirical false discovery rate threshold.
